cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite Construction Studio if you use it in teaching or research."
title: "Construction Studio: A browser-based modeller for construction and structural systems"
abstract: >-
  A parametric model of a building's construction for architecture students.
  Choose a foundation, ground floor, wall or frame, floor and roof; the
  building assembles itself on a grid, with members sized from the span rules
  of thumb used in preliminary design and the arithmetic kept on screen. It
  can be exploded, cut open, stepped through in build order and compared
  against an alternative. It contains no structural analysis, deliberately.
